","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_06052026182412_Outcome_of_Board_Meeting.pdf","ts":"2026-05-06T18:27"},{"k":"call","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_06052026223946_SE_-_Q4_FY26_Recording.pdf","ts":"2026-05-06T22:39"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_12052026162900_SE_-_Transcript_Q4_FY26.pdf","ts":"2026-05-12T16:29"},{"k":"press","t":"Press Release","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_13052026114629_SE_BMAG_Q1_Results_13_May_26.pdf","ts":"2026-05-13T11:47"}]},{"q":"FY27Q1","ql":"Q1 FY27","basis":"consolidated","label":"Strong","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1698553_21072026055208_WEB.xml","ev":{"ts":"2026-07-21T12:43:08","src":"NSE announcement","day":-1.1,"w1":9.3,"m1":11.9},"docs":[{"k":"result","t":"Outcome of Board Meeting","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_21072026124211_SE_FR.pdf","ts":"2026-07-21T12:43"},{"k":"call","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_21072026203347_SE_-_Q1_FY27_Recording.pdf","ts":"2026-07-21T20:34"},{"k":"transcript","t":"Analysts/Institutional Investor Meet/Con. Call Updates","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","ts":"2026-07-27T16:43"},{"k":"press","t":"Press Release","u":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_03082026090019_Sales_Report_July2026.pdf","ts":"2026-08-03T09:00"}],"cm":{"items":[{"field":"summary","statement":"Revenue +65% and PAT +46% YoY — but the growth is optical, driven by consolidating BAIHAG (from Nov 2025); underlying not comparable; EBITDA margin 21%.","quote":"Bajaj Auto — Q1 FY27 (results 21 Jul 2026) Read this one carefully: the eye-popping +65% revenue / +46% PAT is largely an accounting effect, not organic. The takeaway is comparability, not a demand explosion. Numbers. Consolidated revenue Rs 21,689 cr (+65.2% YoY); net profit Rs 3,226 cr (+45.9% YoY); PBT Rs 4,423 cr (+49.4%); EPS Rs 115.5 (from Rs 79.2). EBITDA margin held near 21% . The comparab","doc_kind":"concall","kind":"written summary"},{"field":"improved","statement":"The company's exports and electric vehicle business units delivered exceptionally strong growth during the quarter.","quote":"While all the BUs delivered handsome growth, I would like to call out the super performance of exports and EVs.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Free cash flow generation during the quarter nearly doubled compared to the same period last year, reaching over INR 2,300 crores.","quote":"We generated over INR2,300 crores of free cash flow during this quarter, almost double that of the same period last year, translating into a cash conversion of almost 80% of profit after tax.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Chetak electric scooter volumes grew rapidly by 65% year-on-year, helping drive electric vehicle penetration.","quote":"Chetak, electric scooter volumes continued to scale rapidly with 65% year-on-year growth, driving EV penetration to almost 25% of ICE scooters at an all-India level.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Commodity inflation intensified during the quarter, with metals complex inflation accelerating and impacting revenues by about 4.5%.","quote":"Through the quarter, commodity inflation intensified even further. Inflation across the metals complex accelerated meaningfully through May, taking the overall inflationary impact for the quarter to about 4.5% of revenue.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"The company faced multiple simultaneous supply chain and network disruptions, which increased the complexity of the operating environment.","quote":"The second defining feature of the quarter was the series of supply chain and network disruptions that emerged across multiple fronts, making the operating environment considerably more complex than what we've typically experienced.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Fuel availability became a major challenge early in the quarter due to cuts in industrial LPG supplies.","quote":"To start with, fuel availability became a significant challenge early in the quarter following the curtailment of industrial LPG supplies.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":8.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects monthly export volumes to exceed 250,000 units starting from the current quarter.","quote":"Overall, the exports business, which like I said is 40% of our revenue, has established an outstanding growth momentum and we are looking at moving exports to beyond the 2,50,000 per month level this quarter and onwards.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects supply chain disruptions to ease in the second quarter, which should support top-line growth.","quote":"The supply chain disruption should be easing off in Q2, so it should help grow the top line, and the weakness of the Indian rupee will hopefully be helpful in mitigating cost increases.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"Management expects the future operating environment to remain highly volatile, complex, and uncertain.","quote":"As we look ahead, the operating environment continues to remain extremely volatile, complex and uncertain.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company is expanding its annual production capacity by nearly 25% from 7 million units to 9 million units.","quote":"So, with an eye on the future, we are undertaking an expansion of capacity by almost 25% from the current 7 million units per annum across different businesses to progressively go up to 9 million units per annum.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Chetak production capacity is guided to reach approximately 60,000 units in the immediate term.","quote":"That work has already started. But of course, to address your specific question on Chetak, it will be about 60,000 units in the immediate term.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":13.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Demand for Chetak electric scooters continues to outstrip the company's supply capacity.","quote":"Demand, however, continued to remain ahead of our ability to supply. Capacity expansion has been undertaken, with an immediate and medium-term focus to enable us better serve the growing market.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The demand environment remains very positive in both domestic and key international markets despite some volatility.","quote":"Having said that, the demand environment, both in domestic and international, particularly in our key markets, is very positive, though the business environment may still be a bit volatile.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"Demand has also been strong for internal combustion engine vehicles, especially in export markets.","quote":"Interestingly, demand has been robust on the ICE side too, particularly in exports. The three-wheeler development in multiple markets is driving growth.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"The company implemented calibrated pricing actions between April and June to offset nearly half of the commodity inflation.","quote":"And as I had indicated in the previous call, we responded with calibrated pricing very judiciously taken through April and June, enabling us to offset nearly about half of the inflation through pricing.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Export growth was broad-based across most regions and achieved better pricing compared to the fourth quarter.","quote":"Notably, exports growth was not just faster than the industry, but was broad-based across all the regions, except MENA, this is Middle East and North Africa, for obvious reasons, and was achieving superior price positions when compared to Q4.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The commodity inflation absorbed during this single quarter exceeded the total inflation experienced over the past two financial years combined.","quote":"To put this in perspective, the commodity inflation we absorbed in this single quarter was greater than the totality of the inflation that we've experienced over the previous 2 financial years put together.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Cost pressures have expanded beyond metals to include proprietary components, electronics, labor, logistics, and energy.","quote":"The cost pressures have become more broader, with proprietary components, electronics, electrical parts, labour, logistics and energy and conversion now moving up simultaneously and meaningfully.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"Accelerating inflation across the metals complex through May resulted in an overall inflationary impact of approximately 4.5% of revenue.","quote":"Inflation across the metals complex accelerated meaningfully through May, taking the overall inflationary impact for the quarter to about 4.5% of revenue.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Sequential margin expansion was driven by higher realizations and a richer product mix, which helped mitigate severe commodity inflation.","quote":"The sequential margin expansion was primarily supported by higher realizations and a richer mix that you will see reflected on the GM, gross margin line, which reduced the extent of the severe commodity inflation","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"Margins improved by 110 basis points year-on-year, driven by favorable currency movements and operating leverage.","quote":"On a year-on-year basis, margins improved by 110 basis points, primarily driven by favourable currency movements and improved operating leverage, which more than offset the adverse cost versus price dynamics.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":9.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The electric vehicle portfolio achieved a double-digit overall margin, with Chetak turning EBITDA positive.","quote":"So double-digit overall margin. And if I have to double-click on that, Chetak has now moved from what a few quarters back was EBITDA neutral to now becoming EBITDA positive.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":21.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"Capacity has become a key constraint to growth, leading the company to plan a 25% capacity expansion from its current 7 million units per annum.","quote":"Capacities have emerged as a key constraint to growth. So, with an eye on the future, we are undertaking an expansion of capacity by almost 25% from the current 7 million units per annum across different businesses","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"The company's electric two-wheeler production is currently limited to 50,000 units.","quote":"So, we are right now at 50,000 units. We are limited at that for EV two-wheelers.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"capacity","statement":"Production capacity constraints restricted the sales of certain models in both domestic and international markets.","quote":"Capacity issues restricted sales of some models, both in India and overseas.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"The company maintained a healthy balance sheet with surplus cash exceeding INR 21,000 crores at the end of the June quarter.","quote":"The balance sheet continues to remain very healthy with surplus cash in excess of INR21,000 crores at the end of the June quarter, well managed and providing sufficient fuel for future growth investments","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"Strong free cash flow generation during the quarter reflected the high quality of the company's earnings and robust cash conversion.","quote":"The company continued to generate strong free cash flow during the quarter, reflecting the underlying quality of earnings and robust cash conversion.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":10.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company aims to complete an exhaustive makeover of its product portfolio within the next six weeks.","quote":"Our aim is to accomplish this exhaustive portfolio makeover within the next 6 weeks. So, by the time we meet next in October, we should be able to give you some early reports of their acceptance.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company plans to introduce two new brands in the 125cc segment later this year to attract a wider range of customers.","quote":"Further, in the year, we aim to introduce 2 new brands in the 125cc segment to cover the full spectrum of customers in this large segment as well as proposition customers from the 100cc segment to upgrade.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The expansion of joint KTM-Triumph retail outlets is progressing steadily, with nearly 90 stores currently operational.","quote":"The rollout of the joint KTM-Triumph stores to expand reach while ensuring store viability is progressing steadily with now almost 90 outlets operational.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The two-wheeler industry showed resilience with 14% year-on-year registration growth in the first quarter, despite slowing down from the previous quarter.","quote":"The two-wheeler industry turned in a resilient performance as registrations grew by 14% year-on-year in quarter 1, though much lower than the 25% growth of quarter 4, but under the circumstances, a very healthy performance.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The 100cc and 125cc motorcycle segments remained flat, leading to an overall industry motorcycle growth of 7%.","quote":"The 100cc and 125cc segments were flattish, resulting in a motorcycle growth in the industry of 7%.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Management highlighted that inflation, international logistics, and a volatile business environment are key challenges that need close management.","quote":"But inflation and international logistics will need to be managed closely. Having said that, the demand environment, both in domestic and international, particularly in our key markets, is very positive, though the business environment may still be a bit volatile.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"The company faced several challenges during the quarter, including raw material inflation, supply chain disruptions, and a ransomware attack.","quote":"It was a tough quarter with RM inflation, supply chain and logistics disruptions as well as a ransomware attack, which you may have read about, but it was defended comprehensively and successfully.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":3.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"Having said that, the demand environment, both in domestic and international, particularly in our key markets, is very positive, though the business environment may still be a bit volatile. However, putting it all together, the outlook is promising.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/lkwalimbe_bajajauto_co_in_27072026164331_Transcript_of_Earning_Conference_Call_Q1_FY27.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"}],"kpis":[]}}],"fdb":{"eq":[{"qe":"2012-06-30","basis":"standalone","rev":4713.6,"pbt":1018.4,"pat":718.4,"eps":24.8,"pub":"2012-07-18"},{"qe":"2012-09-30","basis":"standalone","rev":4817.1,"pbt":1040.7,"pat":740.7,"eps":25.6,"pub":"2012-10-29"},{"qe":"2012-12-31","basis":"standalone","rev":5307.2,"pbt":1173.8,"pat":818.7,"eps":28.3,"pub":"2013-01-16"},{"qe":"2013-03-31","basis":"standalone","rev":4651.1,"pbt":1033.4,"pat":765.8,"eps":26.5,"pub":"2013-05-24"},{"qe":"2013-06-30","basis":"standalone","rev":4808.7,"rev_y":2.0,"pbt":1037.8,"pat":737.7,"pat_y":2.7,"eps":25.5,"pub":"2013-07-22"},{"qe":"2